  "hr.offer_regret": [["end", "future", "Staying in touch", "We were impressed by the effort you put into your application, and we hope that you will find the right opportunity soon. Your application and the information you gave us are treated as confidential and are used only for recruitment. If you would like us to delete your details, please write to us and we will do so."]],
  "hr.welcome": [["end", "support", "Support when you join", "Your manager and your buddy will help you in your first weeks, and the HR team is always available for any question about your joining formalities, your pay or your benefits. We encourage you to ask questions early and often; nobody expects you to know everything on the first day.", "Please bring the original documents listed in your offer so that your records can be completed on the first day, and read the Company's policies that HR will share with you. We are delighted that you are joining us."]],
  "hr.probation_review": [["end", "next", "Next steps", "This review is a fair and documented assessment of the probation period, and it will be discussed with the employee in a meeting before the decision is taken. HR will record this review in the employee's file. The employee is shown the ratings and the manager's comments, and may add a written response within the time HR allows. The recommendation above is a recommendation only: the decision on confirmation, extension of probation or discontinuation is taken by the Company in line with the letter of appointment and is communicated to the employee in writing."]],
  "hr.probation_ext": [["end", "support", "What happens next", "The Company will continue to review your work regularly during the extended period, and your reporting manager will tell you clearly what is expected of you and give you feedback so that you have a fair chance to meet it. At the end of the extended period your performance will be reviewed again and you will be told the outcome in writing. All other terms of your appointment continue unchanged."]],
  "hr.confirmation": [["end", "congrats", "Our expectations", "We are pleased with your contribution and look forward to your continued success with the Company. Confirmation does not change your duty to follow the Company's policies, to protect confidential information and to act with integrity. Please sign the duplicate copy of this letter as a token of acceptance and return it to HR."]],
  "hr.increment": [["end", "notes", "General terms", "The revised compensation is confidential and is a matter between you and the Company; please do not discuss it with colleagues. It is subject to deduction of tax at source and to the other deductions and contributions that applicable law requires, and it continues to be reviewed under the Company's compensation policy. All other terms of your appointment remain unchanged. Please sign the duplicate copy of this letter to acknowledge it."]],
  "hr.promotion": [["end", "expect", "Expectations in your new role", "A promotion carries greater responsibility. Your reporting manager will agree with you the goals and the measures of success for the new role within the first weeks, and will review them with you at regular intervals. The Company will support you with the guidance and training the role needs. All other terms of your appointment, including your obligations on confidentiality, continue unchanged."]],
  "hr.transfer": [["end", "practical", "Practical arrangements", "You are requested to hand over your current responsibilities to the person nominated by your manager, to return any Company property that belongs to your present location, and to complete the formalities with HR before you relieve. Your attendance and leave records will be carried forward to the new location without a break in service.", "Please confirm in writing that you have received this order and that you will report on the date stated. If you have a difficulty with the transfer, discuss it with HR before the date of relieving."]],
  "hr.role_change": [["end", "terms", "Terms of the change", "The change in your role takes effect on the date stated above. Where the change affects your pay or benefits this is stated in this letter; otherwise your compensation and the other terms of your appointment remain unchanged. Your reporting manager will meet you to explain your new responsibilities and to agree how your performance will be measured. Please sign the duplicate copy of this letter to acknowledge it."]],
  "hr.bonus": [["end", "general", "General conditions", "The bonus is paid at the discretion of the Company, on the basis stated above, and does not form part of your fixed compensation or create any right to a similar payment in future years. The Company may withhold or adjust it where the conditions are not met or where an employee is under investigation or has left the Company, as the Company's policy provides. The bonus is confidential."]],
